    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81762" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιοδ-εία</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιοδ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going round, circuit</i>, <i><span class="en">
